# Normalize line endings so a fresh checkout on any OS (including Windows
# Git with system core.autocrlf=true) gets LF and produces byte-identical
# release artifacts. The build is reproducible only when this holds.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly keep packaging artifacts and common binary formats untouched
# (none are tracked today, but guard against future additions).
*.whl binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
